From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:10:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Port the pinned NUMOS renderer as Enhanced sky mode 2

Port the NUMOS adapter from Kim2091/dxvk-remix 1532c782 onto the existing sky and VR paths. Scope the host shader identifiers and option keys to the provider. Resolve the built-in weather in memory and ship its shaders, night sky and attribution with the runtime.
