+|rtx.atmosphere.numos.moon1.phase|float|-1|-1|1|The moon's phase as a point in its cycle: 0 new, 0\.25 first quarter, 0\.5 full and 0\.75 last quarter\. A negative value takes the phase from the moon's position relative to the sun, like the real moon\. Set it for a game whose moon follows its own phase calendar\. Its light, earthshine and lit side follow this phase\. A game integration can set it every frame\.|
+|rtx.atmosphere.numos.moon1.rotation|float|90|||The moon's compass direction \(azimuth\), in degrees\. A game integration can set it every frame, which overrides the saved value\.|
