+|rtx.atmosphere.numos.sunRotation|float|0|||The sun's compass direction \(azimuth\), in degrees\. A game integration can set it every frame, which overrides the saved value\.|
+|rtx.atmosphere.numos.sunShadowSoftnessDeg|float|0|||Sun shadow softness, as the sun light's angular radius in degrees\. 0 is physical and follows Sun Size\. A value above 0 softens or sharpens shadows without changing the visible sun disc, for soft shadows under a small sun\.|
+|rtx.atmosphere.numos.sunSize|float|0.545|||The angular diameter of the sun's disc, in degrees\. 0\.545 is close to the real sun\. The sun's shadow softness follows it unless Sun Shadow Softness is set\.|
