+| `rtx_context.cpp`, `rtx_sky.h`, `rtx_light_manager.h` | Call the adapter at prewarm, light update, frame setup, resource binding and post-depth. Give it the prepared scene lights. |
+| `rtx_resources.cpp/.h`, `rtx_pathtracer_gbuffer.cpp` | Manage the per-pixel foreground only for Enhanced and bind it for the G-buffer. |
