@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# numos_host_headers.py
+
+Meson's `numos_host_headers` target runs
+`python scripts-common/numos_host_headers.py <numos-shaders> <generated-include-directory> <stamp>`.
+It follows the host API's `numos/host` and `numos/lib` includes and generates copies with private identifiers,
+including texture names and preprocessor gates. The output tree shadows the standalone library headers for Remix
+shader compilation. The original copyright and licence comments travel with each generated header.
+A successful run writes a stamp and replaces a generated header only when its content changes.
+An unreadable input or unwritable output returns a nonzero exit code.
