+# numos_shaders.py
+
+Meson runs `build <numos> <slangc> <spirv-dir> <stamp>` with Python to compile the pinned library's
+standalone compute passes. It checks their SPIR-V against the library's pass table before writing the stamp.
+The `install <numos> <spirv-dir> <destination>` command stages the binaries, night-sky assets, credits and
+licences under `<destination>/numos`. The runtime opens these files beside `d3d9.dll`.
+A missing input, compilation, pass-table or copy error returns a nonzero exit code.
